{"id":"en_fake-it-till-you-love-me","title":"Fake It Till You Love Me","titleEn":"Fake It Till You Love Me","description":"Orphaned Sylvia and Evelyn devise a scheme: they will pass themselves off as stand-ins for a \"First Love\" in order to get inside the Mitchell family. As part of the plan, the delicate yet fierce Sylvia becomes the wife of Jasper Mitchell, heir to Mitchell Group. What begins as a marriage of convenience soon turns into a volatile mix of hidden truths and mutual attraction. The arrangement starts to fall apart when the genuine \"First Love\" reappears and the deception is exposed. Sylvia then realizes that Jasper was the boy she admired in high school, and that his feelings for her have grown genuine as well. Against a backdrop of peril and treachery, the pretended romance develops into real love.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/fake-it-till-you-love-me/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/fake-it-till-you-love-me/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Secret Identity","Elite","Enemies to Lovers","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df19w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_fake-it-till-you-love-me_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df19w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fake-it-till-you-love-me_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df19w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fake-it-till-you-love-me_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df19w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"